                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[b]World War III: Black Gold: The War Nobody Remembers[/b]\n\nRegret: 64% (Black Gold, more like Black Hole of my time)\n\nThis is an old RTS about a fictional war over oil. It has tanks, soldiers and a lot of fog. It probably felt modern once. Now it feels like trying to control an army through a very old remote. 6 hours of trying to remember what I bought this for. The answer is probably a bundle.\n\n[hr][/hr]\n[b][url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/46453681]Help me out by following my Curator, I'd really appreciate it!![/url][/b]",
